<!-- The shared config.network fetch (plus config.virtualNicManagerInfo and the
     HostNetworkSystem reference) that every vmware_* network check slices.
     Shapes as hostd emits them: leaves untyped inside data objects, the bond
     bridge polymorphic on xsi:type, an EMPTY <security/> container on a port
     group that inherits its policy, keys of the form
     key-vim.host.PhysicalNic-vmnic0 wherever a vSwitch references a pnic.
     vSwitch2 has no uplinks and therefore no bridge at all; proxySwitch is
     absent (no vCenter, no DVS). Addresses are RFC 5737 / RFC 3849. -->
